Strength <after discovering [Steel]>"], "attackSound": "nonmetalhit"}, "Xuanjia Cavalry": {"name": "Xuanjia Cavalry", "unitType": "Mounted", "replaces": "Knight", "uniqueTo": "Sheng Tang", "movement": 4, "strength": 26, "cost": 120, "requiredTech": "Chivalry", "requiredResource": "Horses", "uniques": ["[+20]% Strength <when fighting in [Open terrain] tiles>", "[+1] Movement", "Can move after attacking", "No defensive terrain bonus"], "promotions": ["Shock I"], "attackSound": "horse", "civilopediaText": [{"text": "唐朝最精锐的重骑兵部队，由李世民亲自组建。全军身着黑色铠甲，战斗力极强，在虎牢关之战中以三千精骑大破窦建德十万大军，名震天下。"}]}, "陆羽": {"name": "陆羽", "unitType": "Civilian", "uniqueTo": "Sheng Tang", "movement": 2, "uniques": ["Great Person - [All]", "Empire enters a [8]-turn Golden Age <by consuming this unit>", "Unbuildable", "Cannot be purchased", "Comment [茶圣陆羽，《茶经》作者，煎茶法创始人。一生嗜茶，精于茶道，使饮茶从解渴升华为高雅艺术。]"], "civilopediaText": [{"text": "唐朝茶圣，字鸿渐。一生嗜茶，精于茶道，遍历各地品泉问茶，著《茶经》三卷，系统总结了茶叶的种植、采摘、制作和品饮之法，被后世尊为茶圣。"}]}, "神策军": {"name": "神策军", "unitType": "Civilian", "uniqueTo": "Late Tang", "movement": 5, "uniques": ["Great Person - [All]", "Unbuildable", "Cannot be purchased", "Instantly provides [3] [LegitimacyCounter] <by consuming this unit>", "Comment [唐朝禁卫神策军，宪宗倚重削藩。中使巡视藩镇，宣天子诏令，镇之以威、抚之以恩。]", "Free [Horseman] appears <by consuming this unit>"], "civilopediaText": [{"text": "神策军原为陇右边军，安史之乱后入京成为禁军。唐宪宗时期，神策军是削藩的重要倚仗，天子以此震慑四方藩镇。"}]}, "草原汗王": {"name": "草原汗王", "unitType": "Mounted", "uniqueTo": "MongolEmpire", "movement": 6, "strength": 30, "cost": 220, "requiredTech": "Theology", "requiredResource": "Horses", "uniques": ["[+15]% Strength <when fighting in [Open terrain] tiles>", "Can move after attacking", "No defensive terrain bonus", "Never appears as a Barbarian unit"], "promotions": ["征服者"], "attackSound": "horse", "civilopediaText": [{"text": "我之忽里勒台 -- 向全世界宣告！在天际之上,有许多伟大的光芒。在那天际,有太阳、月亮和星辰。然而,在大地上只能有一位可汗。我,便是那位可汗 -- 最伟大的万汗之汗。当我战胜了盘踞于脚下的毒蛇后,在全体部落召开的忽里勒台上,无人敢再对我提出异议。各部首领争相臣服,献上誓言,渴望追随我征服寰宇。第一缕晨光在地平线上破晓。我跨上战马,麾下的蒙古帝国大军齐声咆哮。我将得到全世界。"}]}, "把阿秃儿": {"name": "把阿秃儿", "unitType": "Archery", "uniqueTo": "MongolEmpire", "movement": 4, "strength": 14, "rangedStrength": 24, "cost": 80, "requiredTech": "Horseback Riding", "requiredResource": "Horses", "upgradesTo": "Gatling Gun", "obsoleteTech": "Industrialization", "uniques": ["Can move after attacking", "No defensive terrain bonus", "[+15]% Strength <when fighting in [Open terrain] tiles>"], "promotions": ["Accuracy I"], "attackSound": "arrow", "civilopediaText": [{"text": "把阿秃儿，蒙古语意为「勇士」「英雄」，是蒙古军中骑射精湛的精英弓骑兵。他们自幼在马上习射，能在全速奔驰中精准放箭，是成吉思汗征服欧亚大陆的战术核心。"}]}}